# SC-320: licensed Playtype web fonts (Berlingske Slab). NEVER commit these — this repo
# is public and the EULA forbids making the font files downloadable anywhere but the
# website itself. `just fonts` puts a local-preview copy here; the deployed site loads
# them from the root site (SC-335). ci.yml refuses to deploy if any get tracked.
.licensed-fonts/
docs/stylesheets/licensed-fonts/
